{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T12:12:22.744Z","author":"pi-toolchain-glm-1103","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"9e1c18dd119f0404d66458ad","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-03T12:12:22.736Z","author":"pi-toolchain-glm-1103","text":"Landed the sentinel migration on top of the current Dependabot head (rebased from the earlier uncommitted edits after the branch moved to the newer merge base; the only inter-base change was the minimatch override and version fields). Verified locally on the pinned toolchain: test/mutation-intent.test.ts, test/scope-aliases.test.ts, test/native-replay.test.ts pass (18 tests including both 500-sequence join-replay runs), test/repeated-targets.test.ts passes 7/7 when run alone. The remaining two 500-sequence files (column-ownership, join-plans) time out on this heavily loaded host (a solo column-ownership run reached 360/500 sequences in its 40-minute budget; the machine load stayed above 20 from parallel fleet test runs), so they are left to CI: the migrations there are the same explicit-unset oracle translations already verified in the smaller files."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T12:12:22.744Z"}],"before_hash":"573089c96ec2f6192e95c229d8230d6a21df17a7426d1bf65ebc18a1224d0b9e","after_hash":"4c59c09287ad87920733909287784e802297a939d91adc1d0d9e0716b5ae7a49","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"3ddb04e0dd2db167f64d6c16911a304be570473f0a8db1fdd80e86a4697fd14e"}
